    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/8999a8d378b0b95e48ca4d5ed378098e.avif?t=1751431024\" width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve become a baron of Solvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your chaotic and disordered domain, you must recruit beautiful heroes and eliminate countless threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies and unexpected events await you deep within the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your strategy and choices to uncover and defeat the mysterious force lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/ff94b1dad79eebd87e9537889def9f58.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Control beautiful and charming heroes!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of stunning heroes, each with their own unique personalities and abilities, and conquer the dungeon through their strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/69e99892ac759820985bfaf09f0a77e8.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Explore uniquely crafted pixel-art dungeons!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into retro-style pixel-art dungeons full of secrets and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run presents new challenges with procedurally generated dungeon layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand each hero\u2019s unique abilities to develop them in the most effective way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/f75ff1f987641cec49989828da237665.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Over 100 events, immersive lore entries, and mysterious beings to discover!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter over 100 dynamic events, where outcomes can be either beneficial or disastrous based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover lore-filled journals and come face-to-face with mysterious entities that reveal the secrets of the dungeon and its world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/f9b9bc7d646c963aae6a98933a7fef0c.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Face off against dangerously charming enemies!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the dungeon, powerful and alluring foes await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten uniquely designed stage bosses each bring powerful abilities\u2014and captivating beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to claim powerful gear and further your conquest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/6cc74ac7710745056c7cf61b48e673b6.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Strategic growth through faith, traits, talents, gear, companions, and more!&gt;</strong><br>Your hero grows in many ways: leveling up, developing faith, unlocking traits and talents, equipping powerful items, and forging bonds with companions.<br>Your strategy determines how efficiently your hero evolves.<br>Enjoy the freedom of building unique playstyles\u2014adding depth to every roguelite adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Flower Dungeon now\u2014a roguelite journey where strategy, action, and subculture charm come together in one unforgettable adventure!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/8999a8d378b0b95e48ca4d5ed378098e.avif?t=1751431024\" width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve become a baron of Solvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your chaotic and disordered domain, you must recruit beautiful heroes and eliminate countless threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies and unexpected events await you deep within the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your strategy and choices to uncover and defeat the mysterious force lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/ff94b1dad79eebd87e9537889def9f58.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Control beautiful and charming heroes!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of stunning heroes, each with their own unique personalities and abilities, and conquer the dungeon through their strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/69e99892ac759820985bfaf09f0a77e8.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Explore uniquely crafted pixel-art dungeons!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into retro-style pixel-art dungeons full of secrets and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run presents new challenges with procedurally generated dungeon layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand each hero\u2019s unique abilities to develop them in the most effective way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/f75ff1f987641cec49989828da237665.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Over 100 events, immersive lore entries, and mysterious beings to discover!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter over 100 dynamic events, where outcomes can be either beneficial or disastrous based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover lore-filled journals and come face-to-face with mysterious entities that reveal the secrets of the dungeon and its world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/f9b9bc7d646c963aae6a98933a7fef0c.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Face off against dangerously charming enemies!&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the dungeon, powerful and alluring foes await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten uniquely designed stage bosses each bring powerful abilities\u2014and captivating beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to claim powerful gear and further your conquest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770000/extras/6cc74ac7710745056c7cf61b48e673b6.avif?t=1751431024\" data-has-big width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Strategic growth through faith, traits, talents, gear, companions, and more!&gt;</strong><br>Your hero grows in many ways: leveling up, developing faith, unlocking traits and talents, equipping powerful items, and forging bonds with companions.<br>Your strategy determines how efficiently your hero evolves.<br>Enjoy the freedom of building unique playstyles\u2014adding depth to every roguelite adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Flower Dungeon now\u2014a roguelite journey where strategy, action, and subculture charm come together in one unforgettable adventure!</strong></p>",
